        "original_id": "34ef90b1-be82-569e-a02a-09617d50e362",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Shihad, Morningwood\n- Person: Hayley Westenra\n- Companies: Capitol Records\n- Products: The General Electric\n- Topics: New Zealand music chart achievements, album releases\n\nFacts:\n- In October 1999, Shihad released The General Electric as their fourth album.\n- During their recording career, Shihad produced five number-one studio albums in New Zealand.\n- Shihad held the title for the most number-one records by any New Zealand artist alongside Hayley Westenra.\n- Shihad also had three top-ten singles in New Zealand.\n- Morningwood was signed to Capitol Records.\n- Morningwood released two albums.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
